{"variant": "minutes", "year": 2019, "month": 2, "day": 24, "slug": "legal/settlement-summary-8890", "variant_int": 5, "html": "<section class=\"page-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"text-uppercase mb-1\" style=\"color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem\"><a href=\"/archive/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">Archive</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2019/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">2019</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/2019/02/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">02</a> &rsaquo; 24</p><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Meeting Minutes &bull; MIN-2019-02-5378</p><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25\">Special Committee on M&amp;A — Settlement Summary</h1><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0\">2019-02-24 &bull; Offsite: The Casino, Chicago, IL</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:3rem 0;background:var(--surface)\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem\">Meeting Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem\"><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Committee</span><br><strong>Special Committee on M&amp;A</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Date</span><br><strong>2019-02-24</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Location</span><br>Offsite: The Casino, Chicago, IL</div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-2019-02-5378</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">5 of 6 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Dov Miranda</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Administrative Coordinator</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Chief Executive Officer</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Gaylord Khumalo</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Manager of Corporate Communications</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Board Chair</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Chelsea Zahavi</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Client Services</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Captive Manager (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Akiko Bolton</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Director of Communications</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Scientific Advisor</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Norzaidi Cantrell</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Enterprise Architecture</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Employee Representative</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Benjamin Robertson</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Enterprise Partnerships</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Mediator (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Total Rewards Benchmarking — Peer Group Refresh</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Total Rewards Benchmarking — Peer Group Refresh was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with the Internal Revenue Code. The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s tax filings and confirmed that they were in compliance.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To declare:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Special Committee on M&amp;A approves the 2019 annual report on Form 10-K for filing with the SEC.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Norzaidi Cantrell &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Benjamin Robertson</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 4 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Call to Order and Roll Call</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">A special presentation on the Call to Order and Roll Call was delivered by Akiko Bolton, an external advisor from Bullseye Compensation Partners. The presentation benchmarked the company against 73 peers and identified several opportunities for improvement. The committee thanked the presenter and directed management to develop an action plan.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for execution:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Special Committee on M&amp;A shall enter into executive session to discuss confidential matters.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Akiko Bolton &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Gaylord Khumalo</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 3 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 2 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Sales Compensation Plan for FY2019</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The discussion on the Sales Compensation Plan for FY2019 was led by Dov Miranda. The committee reviewed the performance of the Bootcamp and Skills Training division in the 2 region. The results were deemed unsatisfactory, and the committee requested a detailed turnaround plan from management.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for funding:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Special Committee on M&amp;A shall enter into executive session to discuss confidential matters.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Akiko Bolton &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Gaylord Khumalo</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 5 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Crisis Management Plan Test Results</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The committee considered the Crisis Management Plan Test Results, a proposal to adopt a new policy on trade secrets. The policy was approved and will be implemented company-wide.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To appoint:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Special Committee on M&amp;A approves the minutes of the meeting held on 2019-02-24 as drafted and circulated.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Dov Miranda &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Norzaidi Cantrell</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 4 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 5</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">IT General Controls (ITGC) Audit Results</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Dov Miranda opened the floor for discussion on the IT General Controls (ITGC) Audit Results. The committee members had received the pre-read materials, including the analysis in Exhibit E. The conversation focused on the risk assessment and mitigation plan. Following the discussion, a member of the committee proposed a motion to adopt the recommendations with minor amendments.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To reconsider:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Special Committee on M&amp;A accepts the report presented regarding the IT General Controls (ITGC) Audit Results, and directs management to implement the corrective actions identified therein no later than 2019-05-28.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Dov Miranda &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Gaylord Khumalo</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 4 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Draft a proposal for a new employee stock purchase plan (ESPP)</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Margit Perry</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2019-04-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Develop a plan for improving the company&#x27;s customer experience scores</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Sangeeta Poole</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2019-04-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Develop a project plan and timeline for the {item_title} initiative</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Emily Cardenas</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">2019-04-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 2:00 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 2019-03-17</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Benjamin Robertson</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Director of Enterprise Partnerships, Mediator (External)</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/2019/02/23/okr-tracking-documentation-8496/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/2019/02/24/legal/settlement-summary-8890/contractor-assessment-report-3819/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\